# Stone stairs, ascending toward +x: three cut steps with recessed reveals
# under each nosing, a one-twelfth base course and a curb along the back,
# so the flight reads as dressed masonry. Same ramp physics as the plain
# stairs; only the boxes differ.
version 1
shape stairs_stone
grid 12
states facing
ramp
box all  0 0 0  12 1 12
box all  0 1 0  1 3 12
box all  11 1 0  12 11 12
box all  1 1 1  11 3 11
box all  1 2 0  5 3 1
box all  1 2 11  5 3 12
box all  4 3 0  5 7 12
box all  1 3 1  3 4 11
box all  5 3 1  11 7 11
box all  5 6 0  9 7 1
box all  5 6 11  9 7 12
box all  8 7 0  9 11 12
box all  5 7 1  7 8 11
box all  9 7 1  11 12 11
box all  9 10 0  11 11 1
box all  9 10 11  11 11 12
